print("A skill that comes with the lamp, wind-down, has fired (it is the hour before bedtime and someone has been at the desk twenty minutes, and the lamp droops sleepily). What the lamp says now: one short, gentle line suggesting they start to wind down for the night. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
